design\communications\peerlist post.md:25:First, you need to separate the work and bring the results back together. That is what worktrees are for.
design\communications\peerlist post.md:35:A card can also be connected to a worktree, so actions and agent sessions started from that card run in the correct working context.
design\communications\peerlist post.md:44:I would be interested to hear how others are coordinating agents across multiple features and worktrees.
